0 0 40 40"><path stroke="#fff" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20 36.667c9.205 0 16.667-7.462 16.667-16.667 0-9.205-7.462-16.667-16.667-16.667-9.205 0-16.667 7.462-16.667 16.667 0 9.205 7.462 16.667 16.667 16.667z" opacity="0" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0px 1px"></path><path stroke="#fff" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 20l3.333 3.333L25 16.667" opacity="0" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="0px 1px"></path></svg><div class="styles_successTitle__BVTfu" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(8px)">Payment Successful</div><div class="styles_successMessage__ZHzSD" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(8px)">We will let you know as soon as your order is on its way</div></div><div class="styles_replay__QXRjy" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(5px) translateZ(0)"><div class="styles_replayButton__KFQJ3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path></svg>Replay</div></div></div></div></div></div></header><div class="styles_section__7KCkB"><div class="styles_heading__gOFHc" style="max-width:800px"><h2 class="styles_text__Fvsk7 styles_title__vat3u">Maximize revenue by authenticating your payments</h2><div>Evervault’s 3D-Secure API lets you implement a 3DS authentication flow on mobile or web so you can easily comply with regulations, shift liability, and reduce fraud.</div></div><div class="Container_container__0SGNv styles_grid__1e45U"><div class="styles_item__uJDYu"><div class="styles_title__JyWP5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Comply with regulations</span></div>3D-Secure is mandatory under regulations like PSD2 in Europe and required by banks and financial institutions across the world. Use Evervault to implement 3D-Secure once and comply globally.</div><div class="styles_item__uJDYu"><div class="styles_title__JyWP5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevrons-right"><path d="m6 17 5-5-5-5"></path><path d="m13 17 5-5-5-5"></path></svg><span>Shift chargeback liability</span></div>By authenticating transactions with 3D-Secure, the liability for fraudulent chargebacks shifts from you (the merchant or service provider) to your customer’s issuing bank. Minimize fraudulent chargebacks and maximize revenue.</div><div class="styles_item__uJDYu"><div class="styles_title__JyWP5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-radar"><path d="M19.07 4.93A10 10 0 0 0 6.99 3.34"></path><path d="M4 6h.01"></path><path d="M2.29 9.62A10 10 0 1 0 21.31 8.35"></path><path d="M16.24 7.76A6 6 0 1 0 8.23 16.67"></path><path d="M12 18h.01"></path><path d="M17.99 11.66A6 6 0 0 1 15.77 16.67"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle><path d="m13.41 10.59 5.66-5.66"></path></svg><span>Reduce fraud</span></div>3D-Secure is used to verify that the person performing a transaction is the legitimate cardholder. Use Evervault’s 3D-Secure API to seamlessly authenticate your customers, taking advantage of the frictionless flow in 3D-Secure 2.0 to maximize conversion rates.</div></div></div><div class="styles_background__rbhqc"><div class="Container_container__0SGNv styles_container__IFQFq"><div class="styles_content__4BIdk"><h2 class="styles_text__Fvsk7 styles_title__Pzt7O">High-converting, developer-friendly 3D-Secure</h2><div class="styles_text__G73wT">Evervault’s 3D-Secure API provides a clean and simple experience for customers authenticating with 3D-Secure, as well as developers implementing 3D-Secure.</div><div class="styles_grid__byXtd" data-items="3"><div><h3 class="styles_gridTitle__8_JqM"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-terminal"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"></polyline><line x1="12" x2="20" y1="19" y2="19"></line></svg>Initiate a session</h3><p class="styles_gridCopy__cfHwU">Pass payment information to Evervault’s 3D-Secure API to initiate a 3D-Secure session. We’ll communicate directly with the Directory Servers (card networks) on your behalf and retrieve a 3D-Secure Cryptogram, optimizing for a frictionless flow where possible.</p></div><div><h3 class="styles_gridTitle__8_JqM"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-user-check"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><polyline points="16 11 18 13 22 9"></polyline></svg>Authenticate your customers</h3><p class="styles_gridCopy__cfHwU">Simply pass a 3D-Secure Session ID to our browser or mobile SDKs and we’ll automatically display the challenge flow from the customer’s bank so they can verify their identity using biometrics, SMS, OTPs, or any other authentication flow that’s supported under 3D-Secure 2.0.</p></div><div><h3 class="styles_gridTitle__8_JqM"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-credit-card"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"></rect><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="10" y2="10"></line></svg>Process a payment</h3><p class="styles_gridCopy__cfHwU">Evervault provides you with a 3D-Secure Cryptogram and Electronic Commerce Indicator (ECI) that you can use with any acquirer, payment processor, or payment gateway. Liability for fraudulent chargebacks shifts from you to your customer’s bank, and your payment is fully SCA-compliant.</p></div></div></div><div class="styles_visual__SiIgi"><div style="width:100%"><div class="styles_container___MMuK"><div class="styles_box__O_s2L"><div class="styles_cross__oL_4w"></div><div class="styles_cross__oL_4w"></div><div class="styles_cross__oL_4w"></div><div class="styles_cross__oL_4w"></div><div class="styles_frame__gDq_A"><div class="styles_frameHeader__RCK8u"><div class="styles_frameTitle__w2Whz">Server</div></div><div class="styles_terminal__hpUZM"></div></div></div><div class="styles_box__O_s2L"><div class="styles_cross__oL_4w"></div><div class="styles_cross__oL_4w"></div><div class="styles_cross__oL_4w"></div><div class="styles_cross__oL_4w"></div><div class="styles_frame__gDq_A"><div class="styles_frameHeader__RCK8u"><div class="styles_frameTitle__w2Whz">Client</div></div><div class="styles_terminal__hpUZM"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="styles_divider__elk7j"></div><div class="styles_background__Lhd1K"><div class="styles_heading__gOFHc"><h2 class="styles_text__Fvsk7 styles_title__vat3u">Integrate 3D-Secure once, use everywhere</h2><div>Evervault’s 3D-Secure API is fully compliant, with a great developer experience and an even better user experience.</div></div><div class="Container_container__0SGNv styles_grid__1e45U"><div class="styles_item__uJDYu"><div class="styles_title__JyWP5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-network"><rect x="16" y="16" width="6" height="6" rx="1"></rect><rect x="2" y="16" width="6" height="6" rx="1"></rect><rect x="9" y="2" width="6" height="6" rx="1"></rect><path d="M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3"></path><path d="M12 12V8"></path></svg><span>Acquirer-agnostic</span></div>Evervault’s 3D-Secure API can be used to perform 3D-Secure independently of any payment gateway, processor, or acquirer. You can implement 3D-Secure once and process a payment anywhere.</div><div class="styles_item__uJDYu"><div class="styles_title__JyWP5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right-to-line"><path d="M17 12H3"></path><path d="m11 18 6-6-6-6"></path><path d="M21 5v14"></path></svg><span>Direct-to-scheme</span></div>Our 3D-Secure Server is integrated directly with all major schemes and is not a wrapper on alternatives like CardinalCommerce. We currently support authentications on Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover, JCB, UnionPay and Carte Bancaires.</div><div class="styles_item__uJDYu"><div class="styles_title__JyWP5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>EMVCo approved</span></div>Evervault is an EMVCo member organization and our 3D-Secure API is fully approved by EMVCo and compliant with PCI 3DS.</div><div class="styles_item__uJDYu"><div class="styles_title__JyWP5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-brush"><path d="m9.06 11.9 8.07-8.06a2.85 2.85 0 1 1 4.03 4.03l-8.06 8.08"></path><path d="M7.07 14.94c-1.66 0-3 1.35-3 3.02 0 1.33-2.5 1.52-2 2.02 1.08 1.1 2.49 2.02 4 2.02 2.2 0 4-1.8 4-4.04a3.01 3.01 0 0 0-3-3.02z"></path></svg><span>Fully customizable</span></div>Our client-side 3D-Secure SDK is fully customizable and the design can be customized to fit neatly within your existing page or app designs.</div><div class="styles_item__uJDYu"><div class="styles_title__JyWP5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg><span>Great UX</span></div>Our optimization engine optimizes your 3D-Secure authentications to ensure frictionless authentications are utilized as often as possible. When a challenge is required, the default styling is designed to maximize conversion rates.</div><div class="styles_item__uJDYu"><div class="styles_title__JyWP5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-terminal"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"></polyline><line x1="12" x2="20" y1="19" y2="19"></line></svg><span>Easy to integrate</span></div>Implementing 3D-Secure and considering all of the edge-cases and challenge flows is complex. Our 3D-Secure API is built for developers and simple by design — while still exposing low-level configuration options for advanced use cases.</div></div></div><div class="styles_section__7KCkB"></div><div class="styles_divider__elk7j"></div><div class="Cta_container__pNx4T"><div class="Cta_gradientWrapper__lGHRR"><div class="Cta_maxWidthWrapper__su_4C"><div class="styles_heading__gOFHc" style="max-width:700px"><h2 class="styles_text__Fvsk7 styles_title__vat3u">Authenticate your payments, shift liability, reduce fraud.</h2><div class="styles_text__6QNZg">Use Evervault’s 3D-Secure API as a single integration to perform payment authentication globally, and process payments with any third-party acquirer.</div><div class="Cta_ctas__1sHaC"><a class="Button_container__i_Vit" href="../contact" data-size="large" data-type="primary" data-pulse="false" tabindex="0">Request a demo<svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 10 10" class="styles_arrow__fxWHa" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 5h7" class="styles_line___qSr7"></path><path d="M1 1l4 4-4 4" class="styles_chevron__pzecF"></path></svg></a><a class="Button_container__i_Vit" href="https://docs.evervault.com/payments/3d-secure" data-size="large" data-type="transparent" data-pulse="false" tabindex="0" target="_blank">Read the docs</a></div></div></div></div></div></main></div></div><footer class="Footer_footer__o4_Ec" role="contentinfo"><div class="Footer_container__Mn8SS container"><img src="../images/icon-white.svg" class="Footer_logo__ZNv_V"/><div class="Footer_navigation__Yj_7L"><ul class="Footer_list__FsWR4"><h5>Company</h5><li><a href="../blog.html">Blog</a></li><li><a href="../careers.html">Careers</a></li><li><a href="../pricing.html">Pricing</a></li><li><a href="../%5b%5b...customer%5d%5d">Customers</a></li><li><a href="../contact">Contact Us</a></li><h5>Resources</h5><li><a href="https://docs.evervault.com/"><span class="d-none d-xs-inline">Documentation</span><span class="d-inline d-xs-none">Docs</span></a></li><li><a href="../papers.html">Papers</a></li><li><a href="../press">Press</a></li></ul><ul class="Footer_list__FsWR4"><h5>Prod